From 4b1fb8b39a1edd092874d1a486cb9e89794c2614 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Angelo Arifi <arifilabs@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 13:49:22 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] lane-298 GDN snapshot-byte floor diag: GGML_VK_GDN_SNAP1_DIAG
 clamps GDN_BANK n_written to 1

Diagnostic only (wrong on any rejected draft): measures the per-token f32 state snapshot write cost of the verify GDN
(36 layers x 3.15 MB x 4 writes at main_b4) for cell run-gsnap.ps1.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
(cherry picked from commit f397a808b4961d5be3a2454936288eb52dc70364)

Origin: ArifiLabs (native) - fork-authored (lane-298); no upstream origin exists.
Measured-effect: UNMEASURED - no served number for this commit in the release ledger or the commit message
---
 ggml/src/ggml-vulkan/ggml-vulkan.cpp | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/ggml/src/ggml-vulkan/ggml-vulkan.cpp b/ggml/src/ggml-vulkan/ggml-vulkan.cpp
index f282da99b6..062e660dd4 100644
--- a/ggml/src/ggml-vulkan/ggml-vulkan.cpp
+++ b/ggml/src/ggml-vulkan/ggml-vulkan.cpp
@@ -12964,6 +12964,9 @@ void ggml_vk_gated_delta_net(ggml_backend_vk_context * ctx, vk_context& subctx,
         // selfcheck plant: wrong-sign bank write, test GATED_DELTA_NET_BANK must go RED
         static const bool plant = getenv("GGML_VK_GDN_BANK_PLANT") != nullptr;
         bpc.wsign = plant ? -1.0f : 1.0f;
+        // lane-298 DIAG ONLY (wrong on any rejected draft): write slot 0 only, measures the GDN snapshot-byte floor
+        static const bool snap1 = getenv("GGML_VK_GDN_SNAP1_DIAG") != nullptr;
+        if (snap1) { bpc.n_written = std::min<uint32_t>(bpc.n_written, 1u); }
         ggml_vk_dispatch_pipeline(ctx, subctx, pipeline,
             {src_buf[0], src_buf[1], src_buf[2], src_buf[3], src_buf[4], src_buf[5], dst_buf,
              ggml_vk_tensor_subbuffer(ctx, bank_it->second.ridx), ggml_vk_tensor_subbuffer(ctx, bank_it->second.wrow)},
